      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i got this really big red bump on my lower back. its super painful and feels like it's filled with liquid or something under the skin. it's gotten way bigger since yesterday and it's throbbing. i have a sterile needle in my first aid kit... can i just poke it and drain it myself to get the pressure out? it's driving me crazy",
